<title>USA: Summit files for $500 mln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Summit files for $500 mln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summit Properties Inc said Monday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $500 million in debt securities, preferred shares and common shares.</p>
<p>Net proceeds from the offering will be used for general corporate purposes, including funding for acquisitions and development activities and repayment of debt, it said.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust did not name underwriters.</p>
